# ============================ VinaX environment ============================
# Frontend (Vite). PUBLIC — never put secrets in VITE_* variables.
# Optional overrides; the app works with none of these set.
# VITE_API_BASES=https://saavn.dev/api,https://saavn.sumit.co/api
# VITE_APP_NAME=VinaX

# ------- Server-side secrets (Cloudflare WORKER `vinax-api`) -------
# Set with: npx wrangler secret put <NAME> --config worker/wrangler.toml
# (or Workers dashboard -> vinax-api -> Settings -> Variables & Secrets).
# They live on the Worker, never on Pages, and never reach the client.
# This file documents names only — real values belong in Cloudflare (or a local
# .dev.vars for `npm run dev:worker`, which is gitignored).
#
# AI lanes — generation-6 env names (v5.21.0, the owner's 2026-09-09 key
# rotation). Each lane pins its own model + provider base in code — see
# functions/_lib/ai.ts (lanes) and functions/_lib/models.ts
# (AI_MODEL_REGISTRY, the full model inventory). Default-base keys are
# nvapi-... unless noted.
#
# Every secret below is NEW: the previous generation was deleted upstream, so
# no probe result carries over. After setting them, open the admin AI Lab and
# ping every lane — that is what re-earns each model its verified status.
#
# Feature lanes (each drives features today):
# VINAX_NVD_NEMOTRON_3_5_LIGHTNING_30B_A3B
#                                dj + chat — AI DJ · Smart Radio · smart queue,
#                                and the balanced assistant seat (realtime)
# VINAX_OAI_GPT_OSS_20B          fast — quick tasks · instant answers
# VINAX_NVD_NEMOTRON_3_SUPER_120B_A12B
#                                deep — the Think button
# VINAX_GROQ_API_KEY             scholar — music knowledge · lyrics · LIVE
#                                voice. Aggregator key (gsk_...): its whole
#                                free chat catalog is selectable in the app
#                                (see /api/aimodels and _lib/catalog.ts)
# VINAX_OPENROUTER_API_KEY       router — the free-model marketplace. Only
#                                models the provider prices at zero in BOTH
#                                directions are ever offered, so this key
#                                cannot run up a bill
# VINAX_NVD_NEMOTRON_3_ULTRA_550B_A55B
#                                home — premium reasoning backstop (550B; slow,
#                                always last in latency-sensitive ladders)
# VINAX_NVD_NEMOTRON_3_NANO_OMNI_30B_A3B_REASONING
#                                search — search-page music expert · discovery
# VINAX_MTA_LMA_3_2_11B_VSN_INT  vision — image understanding (the default)
# VINAX_MTA_LMA_3_2_90B_VSN_INT  vision90 — deep image understanding
#
# Reserve lanes (in the failover ladder, no feature of their own):
# VINAX_DEEPSEEK_V4_PRO_0813     pro — deep-reasoning reserve
# VINAX_MISTRAL_NEMOTRON         mini — general all-rounder reserve
# VINAX_KIMI_K3                  agent — premium reserve; kept OUT of the
#                                default ladder until it is probed stable
#
# Inventory lanes (a key each, so the AI Lab can probe them; no feature
# depends on them — read the registry notes before promoting any of these):
# VINAX_DEEPSEEK_V4_FLASH_0731   VINAX_MTA_MUSE_GLIMMER_30B
# VINAX_NVD_ISING_CALIBRATION_1_5_31B
# VINAX_POOLSIDE_LAGUNA_XS_2_1   VINAX_GGL_DIFFUSIONGEMMA_26B_A4B_IT
# VINAX_GGL_GEMMA_4_31B_IT
#
# NVIDIA_BASE_URL optional DEFAULT endpoint override (lanes without a LANE_BASE pin)
#
# Database (Supabase — service key must NEVER ship to clients):
#   SUPABASE_URL
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
#
# Admin console (…/admin — gates every /api/admin endpoint):
#   ADMIN_LOGIN_PASSWORD   long random secret
#
# Web push (VAPID keypair, generate once and keep):
#   VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY       base64url, 65-byte uncompressed P-256 point
#   VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY      base64url, 32-byte P-256 scalar
#   VAPID_SUBJECT          mailto:owner@example.com
#
# Telemetry / device-id signing (audit finding H-SRV-6):
#   TELEMETRY_PEPPER       HMAC pepper for aggregate-mode device-id hashing;
#                          also seeds the in-memory rate-limiter key hash so
#                          plaintext IPs never sit in isolate memory
#                          (H-SRV-11). Set a long random secret.
#   DEVICE_ID_SECRET       HMAC secret for /api/events signed_device_id.
#                          The client stores signed_device_id_next returned
#                          from first-contact posts and echoes it forever
#                          after. Falls back to TELEMETRY_PEPPER when unset,
#                          but a dedicated value is recommended so the two
#                          can be rotated independently.
#
# Scheduled jobs (GitHub Actions cron -> /api/cron/*):
#   CRON_SECRET            shared secret; requests without it are rejected
#                          (header x-cron-secret only — ?key= is no longer
#                          accepted, audit finding H-SRV-7)
#
# Optional integrations:
#   BRAVE_API_KEY          web search inside VinaX AI
#   GITHUB_REPO            owner/repo used by the APK release endpoint
#   GITHUB_TOKEN           optional; raises GitHub API rate limits

# Native Android background push (FCM) — optional; enables notifications
# even when the app is fully closed. See docs/fcm-push-setup.md.
#   FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT   Firebase service-account JSON (whole file, as a string)
